            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore peyie adol ninye nabatatakino nkejek enyena natiu anaa oltung'ani olotua. Kake aaiteleikia enkaina enye e tatene, nejo, “Miureishoyu, ara nanu ole nkiterunoto o le nkiting'oto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nara ilo oishu atua apa, naa ng'ura aishu taata o ntarasi, naa nanu oata imboleta e keeya o ewueji e nkima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ngero taata nena nidol, enatii o enayooki aaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkisudoroto e lelo akir oopishana litoduaa te nkaina ai e tatene, o lelo kilang'ilang'eta oopishana le sahabu, ore lakir oopishana naa ilmalaika loo sirito naapishana ore ilkilang'ilang'eta naa sirito, pokira naapishana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.20",
